<title>CANADA: Contrans Corp Q1 Nov 30 shr net rises.</title>
<headline>Contrans Corp Q1 Nov 30 shr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WOODSTOCK, Ontario 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.31		   C$0.25</p>
<p> Net			  1,351		    1,213</p>
<p> Revs			23,311		   20,877</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Subsequent to the quarter end, Contrans received a liquidation settlement from a former insurance carrier, resulting in an extraordinary gain of C$463,000, or C$0.11 per share on a basic and fully diluted basis.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
